# Entomb, and Bot2 controls an Elvish Mystic. The enters trigger (it was cast): each player sacrifices all other creatures
# they control, so the Mystic is sacrificed; then each player returns all creature cards from their graveyard "that
# weren't put there this way" - Bot1's Ornithopter and Bot2's Llanowar Elves return, the Elvish Mystic just sacrificed
# does not and stays in Bot2's graveyard.

